      "body": "Analysts have raised the fair value estimate for Steel Authority of India to ₹105 from ₹90, reflecting updated assumptions for revenue growth, profit margins, and an applied future P/E multiple, while also incorporating a slightly higher discount rate. Analyst Commentary The revised fair value estimate for Steel Authority of India to ₹105 sits against a backdrop where recent Street research on other cyclical and higher risk sectors shows how quickly sentiment can shift when expectations for growth, execution, or valuation come under pressure.",
