      "date": "2026-02-20T07:28:00.000Z",
      "title": "Steel Authority of India Limited Announces Redesignation of Shri Manish Raj Gupta as Director (Mining), Effective February 18, 2026",
      "body": "Steel Authority of India Limited announced that the Government of India, Ministry of Steel, vide letter dated February 16, 2026, has redesignated the post of Director (Technical, Projects and Raw Materials) as Director (Mining). Accordingly, Shri Manish Raj Gupta has been redesignated as Director (Mining), Steel Authority of India Limited with effect from February 18, 2026. Shri Manish Raj Gupta, an accomplished professional with over three decades of experience in the steel industry, currently serves as Executive Director In-charge (Operations) at Steel Authority of India Limited. A graduate in Mechanical Engineering from MANIT Bhopal and holding a Postgraduate Diploma in Management, Shri Gupta began his career with Steel Authority of India Limited in 1991 as a Management Trainee (Technic",
